ChainPrint local release candidate

The original project authors have not yet selected a repository-wide software
license for this release. This candidate does not grant a new MIT, Apache or
other redistribution license. The authors must choose and add the appropriate
license before public release.

Numerical source files and operation-parameter banks retain their original
provenance. Exact sources, hashes and packaging transformations are recorded
in provenance/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json. New portability wrappers and tests are
identified by their separate chainprint package and tests directory.

NumPy, Pillow, PyTorch, Matplotlib and optional editor libraries retain their
own licenses. Third-party image datasets and Stable Diffusion editor weights
are not redistributed in this candidate.
